    "blokken": [
      "No complex models. Just clear steps.",
      "How I work.",
      "Independent advice, sharp priorities and decisions a board or leadership team can act on. From first question to working solution: practical, transparent and measurable.",
      "Book a call → See the services → 30 min., no pitch deck",
      "trust, experience, impact ↓",
      "Independent No vendor bias Senior only Since 2006",
